LX51mVENvsejsMDw8fD3HMl8UNP0yUtwRKnYuWMZnEUhGNHI4xEg_QODo9S3Vug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsYif2Zpt3lKvf9JgqYlyfv-qCM1xF11my3FNwY9yV42g&oe=6998473B"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates03cropped.png", "id": "337914812432265", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974774_337914815765598_1762840369253842605_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fm5J0S4s1VAQ7kNvwGd_B5W&_nc_oc=AdlhKIg3_QfR1BaANKsCsUNcNzJgO7Hka6-xRtLKGKMXefaRdGDCGA4pTkyJLm4EXP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftQIw_WzB1Ql4kGJI5wXtzxJgoUcugN5Vmzc_BndIL6_A&oe=699841A1"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates04cropped.png", "id": "367552249204365", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_367552252537698_6058304213158592905_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=51Y42uW8XZoQ7kNvwGiEE-R&_nc_oc=AdmiA1zyD56552NlFjgFkkWdwHEttFbiRjUrfWPK3vSrMHza34nV8IDU88oPEeNAZcY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvGJJ7S3B7ox31ZtHDOEvtrNRBW4vJMct7nOh4QcWtFyw&oe=69987025"}, {"file_name": "Chess cropped.png", "id": "902765531159168", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984463_902765534492501_3956653358745274292_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ljxQnzhyGNYQ7kNvwHUDYRT&_nc_oc=AdktNRYbbsQoXQI9pB-JRHPZQr3BmIFTBM1Jro58zplQhesRVuhw-zcH9hD5aw2WGEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuA1TCMIPIZrdwOFxoPq_m49seJBfo_t--jAHxcR8P3dg&oe=69986B23"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerScreenshot cropped.png", "id": "717849803637730", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982545_717849806971063_8753740338935084738_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bnfRtCDjPjAQ7kNvwGCdK0g&_nc_oc=AdmkvxM8cJjzImYwXmsMb0lbS-mbG_hmBBHSjpoTnmyk8yVvJsVW0IxPRPf3d74Qa50&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfviBAGuZRX8JzMm4AHMqZi8EYwGNjzLJIZZTUpaMy43hQ&oe=69984CBB"}, "display_name": "VRShogiMates", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to VRShogiMates, your gateway to a captivating virtual realm of classic board games! As a solo developer's passion project, this app delivers an unparalleled experience featuring Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and the unique Gungi from Hunter X Hunter.\n\nMultiplayer Mode:\nChallenge opponents worldwide in real-time or correspondence matches. Whether facing friends or discovering new adversaries, the global multiplayer functionality ensures a dynamic and engaging experience.\n\nHow to play:\nNew to these intricate games? No problem! VRShogiMates provides comprehensive rules, instructions, and a game record for each game type to help you learn. Explore the rules, grasp essential strategies, and elevate your skills!\n\nRegular Updates and Support:\nMy commitment doesn't end at launch. Expect continuous updates, bug fixes, performance enhancements, and exciting new features driven by valuable feedback from us.\n\nUnique Highlights:\nVenture into the unexplored VR realms of Shogi, Chu Shogi, Xiangqi, and Gungi - experiences currently not offered by any other VR app on the market! The last game type, Gungi, brings a touch of fantasy to your gaming repertoire. It\u2019s refreshingly different from other board games, check it out!\n\nEmbark on this virtual journey, where tradition meets innovation, and every move is a step towards victory. VRShogiMates is not just a game; it's a portal to a world where strategy, competition, and community converge. Join us and redefine your board gaming experience!", "short_description": "Dive into the immersive world of board games with VRShogiMates! Play Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and Gungi in a stunning virtual environment. Challenge friends globally in real-time or turn-based multiplayer. Learn the rules for all the games, while enjoying regular updates for an ever-evolving gaming experience.\n\nInternet connection is required to play. (For now)\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "develop